    {
      "phrase_id": "11",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_11",
      "next": [
        "111"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "1"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "...it's about time someone whacked Borov! If I knew who it was, I'd buy him a drink.",
      "JA_current": "…Borov がブチのめされてもいい時間だ！ やったヤツが分かれば、1杯おごるぜ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_11#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "21",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_21",
      "next": [
        "211"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "2"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "...someone really pissed off Freedom: I heard one of their groups was destroyed in the Wild Territory...I wonder who did it?",
      "JA_current": "…誰かが Freedom を本気で怒らせた： ヤツらのグループの1つが Wild Territory で壊滅させられたと聞いた… いったい誰がやったんだ？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_21#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "31",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_31",
      "next": [
        "311"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "3"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "...finally someone had the balls to clear out the bloodsuckers in the Wild Territory... What was Duty doing all this time?",
      "JA_current": "…ついに誰かが、Wild Territory の Bloodsucker を排除すべく自らの金玉を握った… Duty は、今までずっと何してたんだ？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_31#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "41",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_41",
      "next": [
        "411"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "4"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "...I heard someone whacked the leader of Freedom. They're in for some tough times I think. Duty is gonna really put a squeeze on 'em...",
      "JA_current": "…誰かが Freedom のリーダーをぶちのめした、と聞いた。思うに、ヤツらはいくらか厳しい局面に直面しているようだ。Duty は本気で圧力をかけようとしている…。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_41#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "51",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_51",
      "next": [
        "511"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "5"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "So you wiped out those veterans? Well done, friend! Six stalkers went missing in that area recently... We all suspected those mad veterans. It's a good thing that they've been dealt with.",
      "JA_current": "それで、お前はあのベテランたちを壊滅させたのか？ よくやった、友よ！ 最近ストーカー6人が、その地域で行方不明になっていた… 皆、あの狂ったベテランたちを疑った。ヤツラが始末されてよかったよ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_51#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "61",
      "text_id": "bar_bar_visitors_1_start_61",
      "next": [
        "611"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "6"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "You turned off the emissions at Yantar? Wow... You're a lucky nut, damn it, I'm glad that someone finally managed to deal with that thing! You can't imagine how many of our boys died there... but now the scientists will work out what it was. We might even be able to deal with the Scorcher now...",
      "JA_current": "お前が、Yantar の放出をオフにしたのか？ わお… お前は幸運の木の実だ、くそっ、ついにやっとアレに対処できたのか、うれしいよ！ 仲間の何人がその場で死んだのか、想像できやしない… だが今やそれが何なのか、科学者たちも理解しただろう。Scorcher を片付けることだって、出来るかもしれない…。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_bar_visitors_1_start_61#1"
      ]
    },
    {
